Core/Jessie: The Bloom. Who came up with that?
Core/Rose: CDC, I think. Early reports called it ‘Verdant Syndrome,’ but that didn’t stick.
Core/Jessie: Verdant Syndrome sounds like a sci-fci movie.
Core/Rose: The Bloom sounded… less clinical. People latched onto it.
Core/Jessie: It’s almost poetic. For a plague.
Core/Rose: That’s the problem with pretty words. They make you forget what they mean.